{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And Moses wrote.</b> After he recounted to them all the words of HaShem, the commandments and the ordinances, he wrote them. This is the Book of the Covenant." "<b>And he built an altar beneath the mountain.</b> In the place where Israel stood at the time of the giving of the Torah. And the word ויבן [and he built] serves on account of another, as if he wrote ושתים עשרה מצבה בנה [and twelve pillars he built]."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:54.268280274Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}